  "lessons": [
    "Bind paints with resolveForConsumer colour + boundVariable; reassigning overrides can leave cached black.",
    "GLASS effect on a filled glyph washes it to clear; use solid fill + shadows for icon glyphs.",
    "Instance-scale of stroked vectors keeps stroke width; outlineStroke() masters that must scale.",
    "Shader property values accept VARIABLE_ALIAS; modes cascade into shader.",
    "Community iOS 27 library must be added to file by user before importComponentSetByKeyAsync works.",
    "Upload PNG not WebP via upload_assets (WebP fills render blank in screenshots).",
    "Adding TEXT props to a set after building variants overwrites per-variant text with the default \u2014 use props only when text is shared.",
    "SF Symbols: SwiftUI ImageRenderer -> PDF context gives true vectors (AppKit NSImage.draw rasterises). Knockouts are SMask soft masks -> subtract in Figma.",
    "figma.createVector() has a default 1px stroke and no fill: set fills + strokes=[] before boolean ops, or flatten outlines the stroke.",
    "Swap icon geometry in place (vectorPaths on the existing vector) to keep instance overrides; move old stroke overrides to fills afterwards.",
    "swapComponent on an instance linked to an INSTANCE_SWAP property changes the property default for ALL variants \u2014 edit defaults via editComponentProperty and show per-use icons on usage instances.",
    "Bash output over ~30KB is persisted to a file; keep pasted data batches \u226415KB.",
    "Component descriptions: write via descriptionMarkdown. Setting `description` HTML-escapes quotes/&/'/<> and read-modify-write compounds it (&amp;amp;quot;).",
    "Setting an INSTANCE_SWAP property drops master-level colour overrides on the nested icon; instance-level colour survives swaps when inner layer names match (all icon vectors are named 'Symbol')."
  ],
